@startuml

autoactivate on

title 권한 관리

actor 관리자 as admin

box "권한 생성"
participant Client as client
participant RoleManagementController as roleManagementController
participant RoleManagementService as roleManagementService
end box

client -> roleManagementController : 권한 생성 요청
roleManagementController -> roleManagementService : 권한 생성 요청
roleManagementService -> roleManagementController : 권한 생성 결과 반환
roleManagementController -> client : 권한 생성 결과 반환

@enduml